{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WYMjRr4XeRRcnAQ9GWosCi","type":"tool_result","content":"| Plan | Monthly credits | Price | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Researcher | 1,000 | Free | No credit card required |\n| Pay As You Go | Not stated | $0.008 per credit | Pay only for what you use |\n| Project | 4,000 | $30/month | Higher rate limits |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom | Custom API calls, rate limits, and SLAs |\n\n**Which plan fits 38,000 credits/month?** None of the listed fixed plans. Project covers only 4,000 credits. Pay As You Go would cost about $304/month (38,000 × $0.008). Enterprise is the other option, since its API call volume is custom, but the page gives no pricing for it, so you'd need to contact sales."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce9a7fa3-a0c4-43e2-a05c-3ee62f440bdb","uuid":"5d393480-8152-4b8f-94fb-fbb5719a4937","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:50:02.602Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":77286,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"| Plan | Monthly credits | Price | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Researcher | 1,000 | Free | No credit card required |\n| Pay As You Go | Not stated | $0.008 per credit | Pay only for what you use |\n| Project | 4,000 | $30/month | Higher rate limits |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom | Custom API calls, rate limits, and SLAs |\n\n**Which plan fits 38,000 credits/month?** None of the listed fixed plans. Project covers only 4,000 credits. Pay As You Go would cost about $304/month (38,000 × $0.008). Enterprise is the other option, since its API call volume is custom, but the page gives no pricing for it, so you'd need to contact sales.","durationMs":3734,"url":"https://www.tavily.com/pricing"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WYMjRr4XeRRcnAQ9GWosCi","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
