{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg8ERSP2uLJ2SuSDp7qBF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"At 38,000 credits a month, no fixed plan fits. Tavily's pricing page lists these:\n\n| Plan | Credits/month | Price |\n|---|---|---|\n| Researcher | 1,000 | Free |\n| Project | 4,000 | $30/month |\n| Pay As You Go | No fixed amount | $0.008 per credit |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom (contact sales) |\n\n- **Pay As You Go:** 38,000 × $0.008 comes to about **$304 a month**. This is the cheapest option the page actually prices.\n- **Project:** it only covers 4,000 credits. Reaching 38,000 would take about 9.5 of them, roughly $285, but I don't think you can stack plans that way. That's my assumption, not something the page says.\n- **Enterprise:** the page gives no price. At this volume, it may be worth asking sales for a quote, since a custom deal could come in under $304.\n\nI got this from a summarized fetch of the pricing page, so check [tavily.com/pricing](https://www.tavily.com/pricing) before committing. Tavily has changed its tiers before, and the page may not show every plan.\n\nSources:\n- [Tavily pricing](https://www.tavily.com/pricing)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":407,"cache_read_input_tokens":19038,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":407},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce9a7fa3-a0c4-43e2-a05c-3ee62f440bdb","uuid":"3e4f8284-4581-4eb8-903b-79029582c455","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:50:07.258Z","request_id":"req_011Cg8ERS6ugyaroD2hVrrCm"}
